title: "G63 Max-Cut: a publicly verifiable solution of 27,050"
abstract: "A publicly verifiable Max-Cut configuration of value 27,050 for the G-set instance G63 (7,000 vertices, 41,459 edges), improving upon the published 27,047 reference (arXiv:2510.21105). Found with population annealing Monte Carlo on a consumer GPU (NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti); includes independent verifiers and checksums."
